Donation disabling source patches for crDroid 17.0 (Android 17)
Public edition prepared 2026-10-01.
crDroid 17.0 edition, 2026-10-20: strict apply and reverse at the reference commits in this
NOTICE. Device-verified on a OnePlus 13 on 2026-10-27 (crDroid 17.0 build of 2026-10-25,
repository commit 4bdecab): no DonateActivity, no pending donation alarm, the reminder
channel is deleted, and no donation prompt appeared. The crDroid 16.0 edition is kept on
branch 16.0 of this repository.

Reference repositories, commits and public sources:
  packages/apps/crDroidSettings 4eeb1fb361a25985b675bf2bad448a8ce963c14f https://github.com/crdroidandroid/android_packages_apps_crDroidSettings
  packages/apps/Settings 927b09818133aa37cf6acd057c656859aa3a5ce6 https://github.com/crdroidandroid/android_packages_apps_Settings

The affected sources carry Apache 2.0 notices from the crDroid Android
Project and The LineageOS Project. Retain their per-file copyright and
license notices. The changes and documentation in this module are provided
under Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). No binaries are included.

Purpose: a personal preference against this form of donation solicitation
inside the ROM, not an objection to donations in general. Maintainer names,
project credits, telemetry and branding are outside the removal scope.

The reminder receiver remains only to cancel alarms, notifications and the
notification channel from earlier builds. It creates no reminders. Unused
translation strings, layouts and icons are retained as upstream resources;
the donation activity and all identified UI entry points are removed.

Validation: source apply/reverse and local Java/Kotlin behaviour probes with
Android API stubs. No ROM build or device acceptance for this public edition.
Branch and device variants require their own source and runtime validation.

Patch inventory:
  donation_components.patch
  donation_about.patch
  donation_settings.patch
